  "hindi": "वास्तु-विशेषज्ञ द्वारा प्रशंसित स्थान पर नायक, वर्धकि और मौहूर्तिक स्कन्धावार को मापें — गोल, लम्बा या चौकोर, अथवा भूमि के अनुसार — चार द्वारों, छह मार्गों और नौ विभागों वाला, खाई, वप्र, प्राकार, द्वारों और अट्टालकों से युक्त, भय के स्थान में और पड़ाव के स्थान में भी।",
  "english": "On a site approved by the site-expert, the nāyaka (commander), the carpenter and the astrologers should measure out the camp: circular, oblong or four-cornered, or according to the terrain; with four gates, six roads and nine divisions, furnished with moat, rampart, wall, gates and towers, both in a place of danger and at a halting place.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "nāyaka.vardhaki cannot be a dual (that would be vardhakī); the short -i shows a compound stem, so nāyaka-vardhaki-mauhūrtikāḥ is one dvandva (nom. pl.) and the e-text's space after vardhaki is probably a missing compound mark; all three are subjects of māpayeyuḥ. 'bhaye sthāne ca' is literal 'in danger and at a halt'; it may mean 'when there is danger as well as at an ordinary halt'. vapra = earthen rampart; sāla = wall; aṭṭālaka = tower on the wall. Hindi: वर्धकि = बढ़ई; मौहूर्तिक = ज्योतिषी; स्कन्धावार = शिविर; वप्र = मिट्टी का घेरा; अट्टालक = बुर्ज।",
  "confidence": "medium",
  "type": "verse",
  "line_ids": [
   "10.01.1"
  ],
  "lines_deva": [
   "वास्तुक.प्रशस्ते वास्तुनि नायक.वर्धकि मौहूर्तिकाः स्कन्ध.आवारम्, वृत्तं दीर्घं चतुर्.अश्रं वा भूमि.वशेन वा, चतुर्.द्वारं षट्.पथं नव.संस्थानं मापयेयुः खात.वप्र.साल.द्वार.अट्टालक.सम्पन्नं भये स्थाने च"
  ],
  "lines_iast": [
   "vāstuka.praśaste vāstuni nāyaka.vardhaki mauhūrtikāḥ skandha.āvāram, vṛttaṃ dīrghaṃ catur.aśraṃ vā bhūmi.vaśena vā, catur.dvāraṃ ṣaṭ.pathaṃ nava.saṃsthānaṃ māpayeyuḥ khāta.vapra.sāla.dvāra.aṭṭālaka.sampannaṃ bhaye sthāne ca"
  ],
  "uncertain": []
