  "hindi": "मध्य भाग के उत्तर में, नौवें भाग में, राजा का निवास हो, जो सौ धनुष लम्बा और उसका आधा चौड़ा हो; उसके पश्चिमी आधे भाग में अन्तःपुर हो।",
  "english": "To the north of the middle (division), in the ninth part, is the king's quarters, a hundred dhanus in length and half of that in width; in its western half, the inner apartments (antaḥpura).",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "nava-bhāga is taken as 'the ninth part' (of the nine divisions of unit 1); 'nine parts' is also grammatically possible. dhanus is a measure of length (a bow-length). Hindi: राजा का निवास = राजवास्तुक।",
  "confidence": "medium",
  "type": "verse",
  "line_ids": [
   "10.01.2"
  ],
  "lines_deva": [
   "मध्यमस्य-उत्तरे नव.भागे राज.वास्तुकं धनुः.शत.आयामम् अर्ध.विस्तारम्, पश्चिम.अर्धे तस्य-अन्तः.पुरम्"
  ],
  "lines_iast": [
   "madhyamasya-uttare nava.bhāge rāja.vāstukaṃ dhanuḥ.śata.āyāmam ardha.vistāram, paścima.ardhe tasya-antaḥ.puram"
  ],
