  "hindi": "इसके बाद, सौ-सौ धनुष के अन्तर पर, गाड़ियों, मेथियों, लताओं की बाड़, खम्भों और प्राकार के चार घेरे हों।",
  "english": "Beyond this, at intervals of a hundred dhanus, are four enclosures made of carts, posts (methī), creeper-hedges, pillars and walls.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "methī = a post or pillar (e.g. for tethering); pratati = a creeper, here taken as a hedge of creepers; the five materials may be distributed one to each successive enclosure rather than all together. Hindi: मेथी = खूँटा।",
